{"id":"48908c72-1d6e-4beb-8501-aca545ec02cd","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"bcb541cc17a11c31","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/times.ts","baseline":{"blob":"008b0a332bff973bc26c9caf7aee469b08efd7b3","start":6672,"end":6712},"shape":{"type":"MemberExpression","atoms":["vscode",".","workspace",".","onDidChangeTextDocument"]},"context":{"before":"1f91607a1bd3c197","after":"ca462e9afebf3ade"}},"payload":{"text":"Edited: what's said no longer matches until the evidence is placed again, once typing pauses.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:20.455Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:20.455Z"}
{"id":"4cffa690-47e0-46c1-99fd-c071b7584276","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"798d7d2003a89ddc","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/times.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a1e899fec36ab7e549cc34a14247d016f9667bdb","start":1207,"end":1261},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","WARM","=","{","\"","dark","\"",":","\"","#e5a050","\"",",","\"","light","\"",":","\"","#bc4c00","\"","}"]},"context":{"before":"0a54e701b9dabfd3","after":"5261886bbe439dbf"}},"payload":{"text":"Time's warm colour, by theme, and its tint at each strength.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:35.340Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:35.340Z"}
{"id":"7972c704-ee4a-4ac3-87f7-94456d1d875f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6ce248d86b320945","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/times.ts","baseline":{"blob":"19a976cf80bd642519ccb04fa2886ac616b2f15d","start":0,"end":80},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","EvidenceStore",",","Placed","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api/evidence","\""]},"context":{"after":"f2517b5f32f25ee8"}},"payload":{"text":"Where a preview's time went, on the code (RUNTIME-EVIDENCE.md, *Time*): each function the runs' profiles sampled says, at\nthe end of its line, its share of the time profiled and its own time a profile (`38% · 1.7 s`), and its head is tinted\nthe warmer the more of the time it took; the hover adds its time with what it called, and who called it and what it\ncalled. What's said is the evidence kept in git (a `time` observation on the function's span: workbench/profile-times.ts\nrecords it with the run that profiled it), folded across runs, users and machines, and fading as runs that profile\nthe file don't sample it. Nothing to open: it's beside the function until the function changes.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:43.518Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:43.518Z"}
{"id":"8452d65d-5b11-45d9-9cfe-2e640a73bf0c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"48492e30501fddac","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/times.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a838f3b3ba687e0e8723aac578a8cd577cca7ce2","start":2966,"end":3040},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","byDocument","=","new","Map","<","string",",","{","\"","text","\"",":","string",";","\"","timed","\"",":","Timed","[]","}",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"7d8a2aa389eaac54","after":"74fd573bcf4f66d7"}},"payload":{"text":"Each open document's timed spans, and the text they're offsets into.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:26.912Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:26.912Z"}
{"id":"b105dc68-a2a5-4317-b9b6-2cb3903d57d6","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"4bcfefd0ec4ed6b2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/times.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f0d4060d9433b89a6eee44bf794d8dd38f7e6cc5","start":6197,"end":6214},"shape":{"type":"MemberExpression","atoms":["store",".","onDidChange"]},"context":{"before":"f9c2b11b1925ed9c","after":"c14aaf2aa65c2f4c"}},"payload":{"text":"A file's evidence changed (a run ended): the editors showing it looked at again.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:22.750Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:45:22.750Z"}
